## E2E Data Flow

```
Android SMS Received
  ↓
[SmsReceiver] BroadcastReceiver
  ↓
[ProcessSmsUseCase] - Validate pattern
  ↓
[SinpeBridgeHttpClient] - Create envelope, sign, hash
  ↓
POST https://api.tonyml.com/api/payments
  Headers: x-api-key, x-signature, x-correlation-id
  ↓
[Cloudflare Worker Proxy]
  ├─ Validate API key ✓
  ├─ Validate signature ✓
  ├─ Validate origin ✓
  ├─ Add tracing headers
  └─ Forward to tunnel
  ↓
[FastAPI /api/v1/payments]
  ├─ TraceMiddleware extracts trace context
  ├─ Validate HMAC signature
  ├─ Check idempotence (message_id)
  ├─ Store in database
  └─ Return 201 + metadata
  ↓
Android receives response (with trace IDs)
  ↓
Update Room DB - status: SYNCED
```

---

## Debugging

### Worker Logs
```bash
wrangler tail --env production
```

### FastAPI Logs (structured JSON)
```bash
tail -f app.log | jq '.'
```

### Android Logs
```bash
adb logcat -s "SinpeBridgeHttpClient:D"
```

### Test Endpoints

**SMS (curl)**:
```bash
curl -X POST https://api.tonyml.com/api/v1/payments \
  -H "x-api-key: your-api-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "envelope": {"message_id": "uuid", ...},
    "payload": {"body": "SINPE 50000", ...}
  }'
```

**Upload (curl)**:
```bash
curl -X POST https://api.tonyml.com/api/v1/uploads/receipts \
  -H "x-api-key: your-api-key" \
  -F "file=@receipt.jpg" \
  -F "device_id=device-123" \
  -F "correlation_id=uuid" \
  -F "image_type=receipt_qr"
```

